#
# RFC 4648 Base64 encoding and decoding. Provides functions to encode raw
# binary data into Base64 ASCII strings and decode Base64 strings back to
# raw bytes. Used by SCRAM SASL authentication, PEM certificate parsing,
# and AWS MSK IAM signature construction.
